{"ref":"BDB, מִקְלוֹת","hw":"מִקְלוֹת","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִקְלוֹת</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.32\">1 Ch 8:32</a> (read perhaps also v <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 8:31\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.8.31\">31</a><sup> ad fin.</sup>, so 𝔊 cf. <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.37\">9:37</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.37\">9:37</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.38\">38</a>.—𝔊 Μακαλωθ, Μακελλωθ, etc.<br><strong>2.</strong>  an officer of David according to <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.4\">1 Ch 27:4</a> (om. 𝔊B 𝔊L Μακελλωθ).","next":"BDB, מִקְלָט","prev":"BDB, מקֵּל"}